WEBVTT

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.500
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:30.480
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.910
who travel the world, searching 
for your ingredients.

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:40.280
And the ingredient at the 
top of this world is GOD,

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.220
which is being sought by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.960
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.600
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.080
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.710
With you guys

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.880
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.320
If we join forces

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.320
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:20.930
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.500
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:39.080
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.330
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.160
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.070
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:16.310
The Cooking Festival is about to begin.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:20.280
IGO asked Toriko to capture 
an ingredient for the Fest,

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.390
so he set off for the Baron 
Archipelago with Komatsu.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:26.590
There, they met Aimaru and 
the other Gourmet Knights,

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:30.730
and together, they tried to capture 
the Plant Beast, Mon Plan.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.700
Meanwhile, Coco went to the kingdom of Jiddal

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:37.070
and Sunny headed for Death Falls.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:42.210
Zebra turned down IGO's request, 
but revisited the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:47.910
For Toriko and company, capturing the 
Mon Plan becomes a desperate battle.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:54.650
Toriko's New Attack, "Nail Gun"!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.780
Toriko-san!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.270
What?! It dodged?!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.880
That wasn't Leg Knife.

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:53.480
It's Leg Boomerang!

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.630
Thank you for the meal.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:26.210
Jeez. You really are like a chestnut.

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.650
Sharp burrs protect you,

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.080
and even though you lose 
them after becoming ripe,

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.220
a hard shell keeps enemies away!

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:37.620
But I wonder if that armor

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.090
of tough skin

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.860
can withstand this?!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.160
50-fold Spiked Punch!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:51.200
Split open with 50 impacts!

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:07.220
Mon Plan's skin

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:09.320
regenerates right away.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.290
So does its shell. And it seems 
to have endless shooting vines.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.560
Oh, no...

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.430
What the hell is this thing?!

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.870
Wabutora, is it?

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:33.310
Then shall we say whoever gets 
the Mors Oil first is the winner?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.710
Fine with me!

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:36.510
What's that?

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:40.550
It's chili oil made from 
extremely spicy red peppers.

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:44.990
Spichili Oil!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.720
D-Disgusting...

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:52.160
You drank oil!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.630
That's something kids 
should never do at home!

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.900
Kids could never do this at home.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:02.870
Because they can't get a hold 
of Wabutora's special chili oil.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.340
In the first place, they don't want it.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.110
And who would drink oil?

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.480
Here it comes! Here it comes!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.880
Observe!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:17.360
This awe-inspiring super-perspiration!

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.490
Secret technique: Oil Sweat!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:23.560
This sweat will blow away Death Falls!

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.430
Mega-oily! Disgusting to the max!

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.670
Spew out!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:42.010
I'm grateful to you about the Four-Beasts,

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.880
but I'm getting the Mors Oil!

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:53.020
The mastermind behind the Four-Beasts...

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:54.290
What do you mean?

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.000
It seems the Four-Beasts

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.860
was revived by someone.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.430
What?!

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.430
The purpose of this trip

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.770
is to gather ingredients for the Cooking Fest

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.240
and investigate the person 
who's pulling the strings.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.440
I see.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:14.710
And so you've come to Jiddal.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.310
Of course,

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.020
I'm not positive.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:22.850
However,

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:26.020
there are a number of possibilities 
that I want to check out.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.660
Doesn't it smell fishy to you?

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.130
The sudden disappearance of the king

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.010
and his exclusive chef?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.660
So you're alive and well, huh?

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.700
Don't cry 'cause you're scared!

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.530
Those tears haven't turned 
into sweet cola yet!

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:17.110
Here on out, a lotta things that are 
a pain in the ass are gonna happen.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.810
So listen up.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.680
Don't die.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.010
If you do,

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.180
I'll murder you!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.360
Be seein' ya.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.670
Toriko-san!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.710
Wait.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:51.880
Look.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.850
He's completely unruffled,

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:58.520
despite already releasing 
two 50-fold Spiked Punches.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.350
The technique of Honoring the Food...

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.620
Maybe it's because he learned Food's End,

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:05.990
but he's calm.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.260
He's watching everything 
with a dispassionate gaze.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.700
Komatsu...

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.740
Come to think of it, it was here.

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:21.270
This is where it all started.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:25.280
My journey with you...

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:26.840
...started...

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.380
...right here!

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.760
A lot's happened.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.160
It hasn't all been laughs.

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:43.960
There were tough times,

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.960
sad times, and everything in between.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.600
But ya know,

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:52.070
it's been delicious.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.540
It's all been delicious!

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.110
All of it

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.580
has made us grow!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:02.710
It's been a delicious experience!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.920
You told me you didn't have confidence

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.790
to participate in the Cooking Fest, remember?

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:13.320
But it'll be alright,

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.630
knowing you!

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:17.960
All of these experiences we've had

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.600
and the lives we've consumed

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.170
give us power!

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:25.570
I should know, since I've 
been traveling with you

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:28.770
and eating all the food you've cooked!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.980
I ain't wrong!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.640
Toriko-san!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:47.830
Knife.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:50.960
Fork!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.630
Just how incredible

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.770
has our journey been?

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.140
Have we gotten strong?

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.440
I'll show you right now!

00:11:18.420 --> 00:11:20.120
With Spiked Punches,

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.730
it takes time for the damage 
to reach way inside.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.030
During the attack,

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.900
it counterattacked

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.530
and even regenerated its shell.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.340
So instead,

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:36.210
I should attack the core of its 
body all at once, hitting it

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.940
with one 50-fold strike!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:41.310
A strong, fast strike...

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:45.580
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:49.620
Thank you for the food!

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.130
50-fold...

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.670
...Nail Gun!

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.470
Thank you for the meal.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:49.450
Toriko-san...

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.280
Nail Gun...

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:53.750
A device that fires nails at rapid speed...

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:57.820
It drove a 50-fold Spiked Punch 
right into Mon Plan all at once.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.720
That's beyond incredible!

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.460
You did it, Toriko!

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:02.990
Yeah.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:06.200
But bringing together a 50-fold in one shot

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.170
is hell on my arm.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.540
I don't think I can go rapid-fire yet.

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.480
He's repelling the water...

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.940
What manner of man is he?!

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.360
What the hell?!

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.260
Oil repels water.

00:13:34.260 --> 00:13:38.500
But it doesn't work against rocks, 
which don't have much moisture.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:40.500
This is vexing.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.070
What the hell is that?!

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:44.640
I mean, gimme back my surprise!

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:45.740
Yeesh...

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.640
Whatever. Now it's my turn.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.340
Spatula!

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.710
How simple.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:58.580
Very well. I'll split the Mors Oil with you.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.250
What?! Really?!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.550
Yeah. The guy who discovered the Mors OIl

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:05.160
would've said the same thing.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.230
The guy who discovered it?

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.990
You mean Chef Komatsu?

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.190
Of course,

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.860
you're participating in the 
Cooking Fest too, right?

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:13.460
Yeah.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:16.700
It won't be easy to win it.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.240
Not with Matsu competing.

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.340
I see.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.340
I look forward to meeting him at the Fest.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.540
By the way, why don't you get 
that off your head already?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:31.450
You've got good balance.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.620
Alright. As for my other purpose...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:38.190
Playing games to win ingredients...

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:41.930
Hey, this is no time to be gatherin' 
ingredients for the Fest!

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.900
I want to play a wonderful game.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:47.830
Because the chance of winning isn't zero.

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:52.900
Komatsu-kun is going to win, you know.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.970
Komatsu will win the Fest?!

00:14:54.970 --> 00:14:57.580
I see. Him...

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.410
In that case, forget about games.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.980
Take all of the casino's 
ingredients with you.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:06.990
I owe Komatsu a favor.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.890
Since he saved the world.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:15.560
Sound Wall!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:19.730
Now nobody can get in the pyramid.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:25.170
Although I doubt anybody would 
dare go in there anyway.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:27.110
I'll be back...

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.540
...to pick up another batch of cola.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:34.850
Enough for a drinking spree to 
celebrate the kid's win at the Fest.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:41.090
I tried steaming the nut wrapped 
in the Mon Plan's leaves.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.820
It's sweet like marron glacé.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:47.390
And it feels like moist Mont 
Blanc cake on the tongue!

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:48.590
This is the best!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:52.430
I feel sorry for you Gourmet Knights 
and your devotion to humble fare.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.500
It's so delicious and 
you can't even touch it!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.370
I prepared this for you two.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.940
Excellent.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:02.440
Clear soup made out of the Mon Plan's vines.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:04.540
Thank you for the food.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.110
It has such a gentle flavor.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:08.980
It's delicious.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.150
Give me some of that clear soup too!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:15.290
And more of the steamed food too!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.420
Keep it comin'!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.990
You can't eat all of it!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.090
We're taking it to the 
Cooking Fest, remember?

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:23.460
I'm putting my foot down!

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.630
Whatever, bring me some more!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.230
Nail Gun, huh?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:30.300
That's an amazing technique.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:31.800
Yeah.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.670
But I still got a ways to go.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.970
Let's meet at the festival.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.710
I gotta get even stronger.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.580
The reason I came here

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:45.080
wasn't just to capture the Mon Plan.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.280
Toriko...

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.350
There's also something I wanted to tell you.

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:51.120
For the sake of what's to come...

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.350
It's gone? Who took it?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:26.560
Here ya go, the ingredient as requested.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.990
Good work.

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:31.760
Coco-sama and Sunny-sama also 
captured ingredients for us.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.030
Um... There's no nut.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.200
It was so delicious that I couldn't stop 
myself from eatin' the whole thing!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:44.180
Then how are people 
supposed to cook with it?!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:47.180
I apologize that only the burrs are left...

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.010
Well, well...

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.620
I came because I felt the 
ingredients calling out to me,

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:55.690
but I never thought one would 
be from the Gourmet World.

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:57.760
C-Chef Zaus?!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.060
Zaus?

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:02.490
T-The Cooking King, ranked as the 
number one chef in the world!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.830
It's Chef Zaus!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.160
I'm Komatsu Gourmet Hotel.  {as per dialogue, he's so nervous that he spouts nonsense}

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:07.930
You're too nervous, Komatsu.

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.970
Compliments on your Medicinal 
Mochi, Chef Komatsu.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.310
Thank you!

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.940
You know my name?!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:23.580
The man who's won the Fest 14 times before?!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.050
I'm moved!

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.650
Please give me your autograph.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:31.990
Before, you said there were only 
burrs left, but that's incorrect.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.330
Mon Plan...

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.230
It appeared in the Human World once before,

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.760
when President Ichiryu 
fought the Four-Beasts.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.200
I learned something then.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.870
A chestnut's burrs are inedible,

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.710
but this Mon Plan's burrs

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:52.980
can be eaten if they're crushed finely.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.180
You should remember that.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.680
Well, we'll meet again at the Fest.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:02.820
You're gonna have a hard time 
winning the Fest this year!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.260
Big upsets do happen!

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:08.360
The reason I say so is my partner, 
Komatsu, is gonna be in it!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.600
Toriko-san...

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:19.770
That's Chef Zaus for you!

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.810
But why did you say all that?!

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:27.280
Like there's going to be a 
big upset because I'm in it!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:29.350
Now my goose is cooked...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.180
Don't worry about it!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.950
You can beat that guy!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.350
I believe in you!

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.290
Toriko-san...

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:44.160
Actually, it's always been my 
dream to participate in the Fest.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:49.170
I want to become the kind of chef that 
someday gets to be in the Cooking Fest!

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.470
We <i>can</i> be in it!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:54.170
Right now, we're still in training, 
but I know we'll be able to be in it!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.240
You're right! Take-chan, Ume-chan...

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:02.050
Let's all become first-rate chefs 
and meet up at the Cooking Fest!

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:03.780
I'll do my best.

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.950
Yeah. Show me

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.490
your true ability!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.390
I will!

